# tests/chat-squash-publish, as an ENTRY: evaluating this directory yields the
# test's ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST: design/stacks.md's publishing steps, create-squashed-stack
# then publish_source, run through llm-step's real tool loop with a scripted
# model. It runs on std/go, which std/caos-test grants the mock model key, so
# this test's ArgTree carries the `secret-hash` llm-step's admission names.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go --bash-tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash-tool --squash:@=DEEP-DEPS/create-squashed-stack --llm-step:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-step --stub:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-stub --tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-test-tool
